# A cast the Cleric spends a swing on when they drop below a quarter of their
# HP -- see fight.h. Not a swing they choose between: the fight reaches for it
# on need and for nothing else.
#
# GMS restores 15% a level over 20 levels, which is 300% at max. That figure
# is written for a party, and against one player it clamps to a full heal from
# level 4 up -- six levels that buy nothing. 10% a level over 10 instead, so
# the ladder ends exactly at a full pool and every point on it moves.
#
# The party it is shared with, the undead it hurts and the cooldown the party
# shortens are all still absent, as is the cooldown itself.
name: "Heal"
skill_order: 3
description: "Restores your HP."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
tags: SKILL_TAG_BENEVOLENCE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CLERIC
max_level: 10
base_delay_ms: 600
base { heal_pct: 0.10 }
per_level { heal_pct: 0.10 }
